            "notes": "We can now choose the power [Back Off](item_cf806fa3-c276-4898-a092-7d7f1a908821) and start to use the biotic field damage/heal strategy, to do this we start by choosing  [Battery Pack](item_5ff8a68c-8f07-4531-9050-5cc5d9128b77) and [Rapid Response Radius](item_18720a42-a523-4dbc-9114-891c37a79331) this gives us a much larger and longer lasting biotic field. \n\nWe can start to use the strategy of running around on the point however we have 2 issues, 1 we don't have  [Track and Field](item_b3750fe4-e416-42b6-ad9e-fe92c7dcffc5) yet so the biotic field cannot be deployed constantly and 2 we are still quite squishy so use the strategy carefully in bursts at moments when you have good team support. Outside these moments focus on doing damage with your rockets.",
