            "notes": "This round we get the power [Track and Field](item_b3750fe4-e416-42b6-ad9e-fe92c7dcffc5) this means we can constantly use our biotic field if you keep running so run rabbit run! no more selective use of our biotic field it will now be our primary damage output while also making you the third or even best healer on your team!\n\nWe also get [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) this means every time we activate our biotic field we get 50 shields back spread out over 2 seconds making our soldier very tough.\n\nI also reccomend selling [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) so we can get [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e) and  [Compression Fatigues](item_a15ed6e6-1f60-4b4c-8f51-ad1ee1140ae3) in return.\n\nAnother option is getting [Compression Fatigues](item_a15ed6e6-1f60-4b4c-8f51-ad1ee1140ae3) instead of [Battery Pack](item_5ff8a68c-8f07-4531-9050-5cc5d9128b77) so we can keep our [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) however this only gives us 5% more ability damage while costs 500 less so if possible i wouldn't do this.",
